      "content": "hey i need some help with some research... i've been looking into why everyone seems so tired and uninspired lately and i think i found something with the grid frequency. i think the standard 440hz or whatever they use for the power distribution is actually tuned to suppress certain brainwaves. can u help me verify if there's any evidence the gov uses frequency modulation specifically for social control or lethargy induction?",
